u4: $ G , j ∊ ω , ∀ v (v ∊ fseq A → cdm v = j → v ∊ P) , w = suc j , v ∊ fseq A , cdm v = w , a ∊ A ∧ b ∊ fseq A ∧ v = scons a b , c = cdm b , c ∊ ω ⇒ suc c = suc j $ by eq_trans [u2, u3]
