a1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ax
a2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ s ∨ z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by cun_elim [a1]
a3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ s ⇒ z ∊ s $ by ax
a4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ s ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by cun_intro_l [a3]
b1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ax
b2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by csn_elim [b1]
b3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ nadd k ∅ = k $ by nadd_zero
b4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ k = nadd k ∅ $ by eq_sym [b3]
b5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , a ⟩ = ⟨ nadd k ∅ , a ⟩ $ by opair_eq [b4, eq_refl []]
b6: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ nadd k ∅ , a ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b2, b5]
b7: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ $ by s2_scons_zero [isset_var []]
b8: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by s2_sh_intro [b6, b7, ax_empty []]
b9: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by cun_intro_r [b8]
a5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by or_elim [a2, a4, b9]
m1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by ax
m2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ z ∊ s ∨ z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by cun_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z ∊ s ⇒ z ∊ s $ by ax
