n1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by ax
n2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ ∃ j ∃ g (z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅) $ by cab_elim (x := $ w $, t := $ z $, p := $ ∃ j ∃ g (w = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅) $) [n1]
