p4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ ⇒ (j = ∅ ∧ g = a) ∨ ∃ i (j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅) $ by scons_pair [p3, isset_var [], isset_var []]
q1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ j = ∅ ∧ g = a $ by ax
q2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ j = ∅ $ by and_elim_l [q1]
q3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ g = a $ by and_elim_r [q1]
q4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ nadd k j = nadd k ∅ $ by nadd_eq [eq_refl [], q2]
q5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ nadd k ∅ = k $ by nadd_zero
q6: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ nadd k j = k $ by eq_trans [q4, q5]
q7: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ = ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q6, q3]
q8: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ z = ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by eq_trans [weaken [p2], q7]
q9: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ z ∊ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by csn_intro [q8]
q10: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = ∅ ∧ g = a ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by cun_intro_r [q9]
r1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ $ by ax
r2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ $ by and_elim_r [r1]
r3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ , v = ⟨ i , g ⟩ , v ∊ ∅ ⇒ v ∊ ∅ $ by ax
r4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ , v = ⟨ i , g ⟩ , v ∊ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by empty_elim [r3]
r5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by wcel_elim [r2, r4]
r6: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅ ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by bot_elim [r5]
r7: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , ∃ i (j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅) ⇒ ∃ i (j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅) $ by ax
r8: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ , ∃ i (j = suc i ∧ ⟨ i , g ⟩ ∈ ∅) ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ex_elim [r7, r6]
p5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅ ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by or_elim [p4, q10, r8]
p6: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , ∃ g (z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅) ⇒ ∃ g (z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅) $ by ax
p7: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , ∃ g (z = ⟨ nadd k j , g ⟩ ∧ ⟨ j , g ⟩ ∈ scons a ∅) ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ex_elim [p6, p5]
p8: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k , z ∊ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by ex_elim [n2, p7]
m5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , z ∊ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k ⇒ z ∊ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ $ by or_elim [m2, m4, p8]
w1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ s ∪ csn ⟨ k , a ⟩ = s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by eq_intro [a5, m5]
w2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ ssnoc s a = s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k $ by eq_trans [e1, w1]
w3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ s ∪ s2_sh (scons a ∅) k = scat s (scons a ∅) $ by eq_sym [e2]
w4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ ssnoc s a = scat s (scons a ∅) $ by eq_trans [w2, w3]
w5: $ G ⇒ ssnoc s a = scat s (scons a ∅) $ by wcel_elim [l1, w4]

fv_ccom
-------
l1: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ b = fv s i $ by ax
l2: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ b ∊ cdm F $ by ax
l3: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ functional s $ by weaken [#2]
l4: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
l5: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ by weaken [#3]
l6: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ ∈ s $ by fv_in [l3, l5]
l7: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ fv s i = b $ by eq_sym [l1]
l8: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ = ⟨ i , b ⟩ $ by opair_eq [eq_refl [], l7]
l9: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ ⟨ i , b ⟩ ∈ s $ by wcel_eq_l [l8, l6]
l10: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ ⟨ b , fv F b ⟩ ∈ F $ by fv_in [l4, l2]
l11: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ isset (fv F b) $ by fv_set [l4]
m1: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ c = fv F b $ by ax
m2: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ fv F b = c $ by eq_sym [m1]
m3: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ ⟨ b , fv F b ⟩ = ⟨ b , c ⟩ $ by opair_eq [eq_refl [], m2]
m4: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ ⟨ b , c ⟩ ∈ F $ by wcel_eq_l [m3, weaken [l10]]
m5: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ ccom F s $ by ccom_intro [weaken [l9], m4]
m6: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ functional (ccom F s) $ by ccom_functional [weaken [l4], weaken [l3]]
m7: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ fv (ccom F s) i = c $ by fv_val [m6, m5]
m8: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ fv (ccom F s) i = fv F b $ by eq_trans [m7, m1]
m9: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ fv F b = fv F (fv s i) $ by fv_eq [eq_refl [], weaken [l1]]
m10: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F , c = fv F b ⇒ fv (ccom F s) i = fv F (fv s i) $ by eq_trans [m8, m9]
l12: $ G , b = fv s i , b ∊ cdm F ⇒ fv (ccom F s) i = fv F (fv s i) $ by isset_elim [l11, m10]
l13: $ G ⇒ fv (ccom F s) i = fv F (fv s i) $ by wcel_elim [#4, l12]

lemma s2_ccom_cdm (G: hyps) (F A B: class) (s: set):
  $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ fn_into F A B $ > $ G ⇒ cdm (ccom F s) = cdm s $
----
a1: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
a2: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ x ∊ cdm s $ by cdm_intro [a1]
a3: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s $ by ax
a4: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s ⇒ x ∊ cdm s $ by ccom_elim [a3, a2]
a5: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) ⇒ x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) $ by ax
a6: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) ⇒ x ∊ cdm s $ by cdm_elim [a5, a4]
b1: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
b2: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ u ∊ crn s $ by crn_intro [b1]
b3: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
b4: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ crn s ⊆ A $ by fseq_crn [b3]
b5: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ u ∊ A $ by subset_elim [b4, b2]
b6: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fn_into F A B $ by weaken [#2]
c1: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
c2: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
c3: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ ccom F s $ by ccom_intro [c1, c2]
c4: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) $ by cdm_intro [c3]
b7: $ G , x ∊ cdm s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) $ by fn_into_elim [b6, b5, c4]
b8: $ G , x ∊ cdm s ⇒ x ∊ cdm s $ by ax
b9: $ G , x ∊ cdm s ⇒ x ∊ cdm (ccom F s) $ by cdm_elim [b8, b7]
b10: $ G ⇒ cdm (ccom F s) = cdm s $ by eq_intro [a6, b9]

ccom_fseq
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional F $ by fn_into_functional [#2]
l2: $ G ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ functional (ccom F s) $ by ccom_functional [l1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ rel (ccom F s) $ by ccom_rel
l5: $ G ⇒ cdm (ccom F s) = cdm s $ by s2_ccom_cdm [#1, #2]
l6: $ G ⇒ cdm s = cdm (ccom F s) $ by eq_sym [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ cdm s ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [#1]
l8: $ G ⇒ cdm (ccom F s) ∈ ω $ by wcel_eq_l [l6, l7]
a1: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ u ∊ crn s $ by crn_intro [a1]
a3: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
a4: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ crn s ⊆ A $ by fseq_crn [a3]
a5: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ u ∊ A $ by subset_elim [a4, a2]
a6: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ fn_into F A B $ by weaken [#2]
b1: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
b2: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
b3: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ F , v ∊ B , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [l1]
