c8: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ K , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
c9: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ K , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom H s $ by ccom_intro [c8, c7]
b4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s , ⟨ x , u ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ u , y ⟩ ∈ K ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom H s $ by cdm_elim [b3, c9]
b5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s $ by ax
b6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom K s ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ccom H s $ by ccom_elim [b5, b4]
w1: $ G ⇒ ccom H s = ccom K s $ by rel_eq_intro [l1, l2, a6, b6]

universe_fseq_elem
------------------
l1: $ G ⇒ rel s $ by fseq_rel [#3]
l2: $ G ⇒ s ⊆ cdm s × crn s $ by rel_subset_cxp [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ a $ by fseq_crn [#3]
l4: $ G ⇒ cdm s ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [#3]
c1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ k = cdm s $ by ax
c2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
c3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ cdm s = k $ by eq_sym [c1]
c4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ cdm s ⊆ k $ by eq_subset [c3]
c5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ cdm s × crn s ⊆ k × a $ by cxp_mono [c4, weaken [l3]]
c6: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ s ⊆ k × a $ by subset_trans [weaken [l2], c5]
c7: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#1]
c8: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ a ∊ U $ by weaken [#2]
c9: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ k ∊ U $ by universe_omega_elem [c7, c8, c2]
c10: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ k × a ∈ U $ by universe_cxp [c7, c9, c8]
d1: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , c = k × a , c ∊ U ⇒ c = k × a $ by ax
d2: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , c = k × a , c ∊ U ⇒ c ∊ U $ by ax
d3: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , c = k × a , c ∊ U ⇒ k × a = c $ by eq_sym [d1]
d4: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , c = k × a , c ∊ U ⇒ s ⊆ c $ by subset_eq_r [d3, weaken [c6]]
d5: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω , c = k × a , c ∊ U ⇒ s ∈ U $ by universe_subset [weaken [c7], d2, d4]
c11: $ G , k = cdm s , k ∊ ω ⇒ s ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [c10, d5]
c12: $ G ⇒ s ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [l4, c11]

universe_fseq
-------------
a1: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ v ∊ fseq a $ by ax
a2: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ rel v $ by fseq_rel [a1]
a3: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ v ⊆ cdm v × crn v $ by rel_subset_cxp [a2]
a4: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ crn v ⊆ a $ by fseq_crn [a1]
a5: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ cdm v ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [a1]
b1: $ G , v ∊ fseq a , k = cdm v , k ∊ ω ⇒ k = cdm v $ by ax
b2: $ G , v ∊ fseq a , k = cdm v , k ∊ ω ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
b3: $ G , v ∊ fseq a , k = cdm v , k ∊ ω ⇒ k ⊆ ω $ by omega_elem_subset [b2]
