a6: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ cdm v ⊆ ω $ by wcel_elim [a5, b4]
a7: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ cdm v × crn v ⊆ ω × a $ by cxp_mono [a6, a4]
a8: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ v ⊆ ω × a $ by subset_trans [a3, a7]
a9: $ G , v ∊ fseq a ⇒ v ∊ 𝒫 (ω × a) $ by cpw_intro [a8]
a10: $ G ⇒ fseq a ⊆ 𝒫 (ω × a) $ by subset_intro [a9]
c1: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ f = ω $ by ax
c2: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ f ∊ U $ by ax
c3: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#1]
c4: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ a ∊ U $ by weaken [#3]
c5: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ f × a ∈ U $ by universe_cxp [c3, c2, c4]
c6: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ f × a = ω × a $ by cxp_eq [c1, eq_refl []]
c7: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ ω × a ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [c6, c5]
d1: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U ⇒ g = ω × a $ by ax
d2: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U ⇒ g ∊ U $ by ax
d3: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U ⇒ 𝒫 g ∈ U $ by universe_cpw [weaken [c3], d2]
e1: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ j = 𝒫 g $ by ax
e2: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ j ∊ U $ by ax
e3: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ ω × a = g $ by eq_sym [weaken [d1]]
e4: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ 𝒫 (ω × a) = 𝒫 g $ by cpw_eq [e3]
e5: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ 𝒫 g = j $ by eq_sym [e1]
e6: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ 𝒫 (ω × a) = j $ by eq_trans [e4, e5]
e7: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ fseq a ⊆ j $ by subset_eq_r [e6, weaken [a10]]
e8: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U , j = 𝒫 g , j ∊ U ⇒ fseq a ∈ U $ by universe_subset [weaken [c3], e2, e7]
d4: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U , g = ω × a , g ∊ U ⇒ fseq a ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [d3, e8]
c8: $ G , f = ω , f ∊ U ⇒ fseq a ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [c7, d4]
c9: $ G ⇒ fseq a ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [#2, c8]
